# Frontend ownership freeze (D-050)

## Binding

Owner + ChatGPT design and create production **member WWW** (`codex/phase5-*`, `preview/destiled-web`, PR #30 direction).

Cursor **integrates** approved frontend to API, Identity, Authorization, Discord, data, Zeabur.

Workflow SoT: `docs/product/WEB_PRODUCT_DESIGN_AND_DELIVERY.md`.

## Cursor must not

- Redesign competing member WWW IA/navigation/layouts/visual identity.
- Treat PR #19 `apps/web` UI or legacy guild app as final product design SoT.
- Invent new member product screens from endpoints/tables without Owner-approved frontend slice.
- Start Task 007 / Trackers / deferred product modules before 005/006 tip deploy + acceptance are ordered.

## Cursor may

- Backend, security, CI, migrations, Discord Gateway, Admin Control Center plumbing when not inventing competing member WWW design.
- Wire approved frontend adapters to real services.
- Preserve existing web/admin code as technical material (do not delete solely because design track supersedes visuals).

